             A decorative ceramic pitcher with a softly curved silhouette,
             delicate botanical pattern and vintage-inspired crackle-glaze finish.
             Its warm ivory, green and ochre tones bring an understated,
             collected character to flowers, table settings and quiet corners of the home.
          </p>


